&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The&amp;nbsp;estimated&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;pay range for this role is $260K - $326K.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Additionally, this role is eligible to participate in Temporal&#39;s equity plan.&lt;/li&gt;
