&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience delivering and operating production systems where reliability and incident response matter&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of distributed systems, failure modes, scaling tradeoffs, and operational safety&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on coding ability in at least one major language such as Go, Java, Python, or TypeScript&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience deploying and operating production services in cloud and or self-hosted environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to design and communicate operational standards, including on-call readiness, runbooks, and capacity planning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working directly with customers in high-stakes delivery moments, with a calm and credible approach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong debugging skills and ability to navigate ambiguity and messy real-world constraints&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to teach and enable other engineers, not just deliver the work directly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
