&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to create reusable reference architectures, templates, or internal enablement programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong partnership skills to collaborate with product and engineering teams and translate field learnings into roadmap improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in working with partners or services delivery models at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
