&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ipd2wb&quot; data-start=&quot;1661&quot; data-end=&quot;1814&quot;&gt;Partner with People Operations, IT, Finance, Developer Relations, and business leaders to align workplace initiatives with employee and business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
