&lt;li&gt;7+ years of software engineering experience with a strong focus on distributed systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Based in Berlin, Germany, with the right to work in Germany&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in one or more Temporal SDK languages (Python, Go, Java, TypeScript), with strong working knowledge of distributed systems, state management, and workflow execution concepts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to lead technical workshops, hands-on labs, or enablement sessions for senior engineering audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience engaging directly with enterprise engineering organizations, with an understanding of how large teams adopt and scale developer tooling&lt;/li&gt;
